The module scripts in module/ come from Zairenkai-Core and Zairenkai-FAS, which have the same
owner and licence, and were merged into one module here. The Magisk installer stub in
module/META-INF is independently written; it calls Magisk's documented installer interface
(util_functions.sh, install_module) and contains no Magisk code.

The module zip carries each component's own LICENSE, NOTICE and THIRD_PARTY.md under
licenses/<component>/. No third-party source code is included in this repository.
